# Attuma's trigger is for Merfolk that "attack a player" (CR 508.1): attacking a planeswalker does not count. Bot2's Ral Zarek,
# Guest Lecturer ({1}{B}{B} from Black Lotus) is attacked by Attuma on turn 3: no card (library 12 after the draw step, still
# 12 after combat). On turn 5 Attuma attacks Bot2 itself: the draw (11 after the draw step, 10 after the trigger).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Attuma, Atlantean Warlord
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer
Island x5
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Attuma, Atlantean Warlord.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Attuma, Atlantean Warlord > Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Library.Count = 12
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Attuma, Atlantean Warlord > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Life = 17
